  "description": {
   "en": "Dragons have been rampant since ancient times, and the existence of \"dragon hunters\" is indispensable in the kingdom of \"Tomur\". In the remote \"Rosenfield District\" there is a soapland that Japan is proud of, called \"Kaguya\"!! \"Another world\" and \"soapland\" are connected. The battle between the famous heroes \"Dragon Hunters\" and the \"Bubble Princesses\" has begun! The Bubble Princesses have appeared! A blow of pleasure!! What! It was \"lotion\"!! The heroes came...! But what! The heroes got up again and looked at the shop with a look that seemed to want to see the Bubble Princess again! What! The heroes started to visit frequently!! The hero party!! Please enjoy the best hospitality of the Bubble Princesses!! This time, what a surprise!! We will guide the owner of \"Kaguya\", [Kakuta Ichimatsu], to further climax!! Tanya has been awakened by intercourse with Kakuta!! The battle will reach its final stage with climax after climax!! An explosion of sexual techniques!!! A total erection!!! How will this forbidden love end...?"
  },
